\subsection{Profile and Reliability}

The profile page (Figure~2.7) surfaces the fields that the trust-and-safety layer depends on: a verified
badge, branch and year of study, a reliability score out of 100, and a count of goals completed. A profile
that is missing branch or year is nudged towards completion, since these fields feed the rule-based match
suggestions described in the project proposal.

